R('T',"Engineer's Table: first use","First crafting at a workbench earns Martha Stewart and a Bronze Crafter's Box (Carl, Goo-Inator on a breastplate, Floor 4).","B3 ch4","V cite B3 ch4","W:Martha Stewart Achievement","You used a workbench to craft for the first time.")
