R('T',"Sapper's Table: level 1","Level 1: add modules to traps, deconstruct bombs (needs Bomb Surgeon), modify bombs; bombs do not decay or prematurely detonate while the crawler stands at the table.","B3 ch10; B1 ch41","V cite B3 ch10","W:Sapper's Table","Bomb stability will not decay while the crawler is standing at the table, and bombs and traps cannot prematurely detonate.")
