R('T',"Sapper's Table: Demolitions Workshop menu","Standing at the table with Explosives Handling 5+ unlocks the Demolitions Workshop crawler menu.","B1 ch19","V cite B1 ch19 (+YT)","W:Demolition Workshop Tab","However he cannot access it until he is standing at a Sapper's Table.","YT:j6jRXuCgsAA","new demolitions workshop menu")
R('T',"Alchemy Table: source (Carl, Floor 2)","An Alchemy Table was looted from a Rev-Up filling room on Floor 2; Carl later sheltered under one from his inventory.","B1 ch33,35","V cite B1 ch33",C,"Alchemy Table: looted from a Rev-Up filling room on the Second Floor.","YT:j6jRXuCgsAA","shelters behind a metal alchemy table pulled from his inventory")
R('T',"Alchemy Table: function","Transforms dungeon loot such as organs and skins into potions; includes tools and resources but not necessarily recipes.","B3 ch4","V cite B3 ch4","W:Alchemy Table","Although the table includes tools and resources, it does not necessarily include recipes.")
R('T',"Alchemy Table: level 1 and 3","Level 1 looks like an ordinary table; level 3 is three times base size with faucet, shelves and drawers.","B3 ch7","V cite B3 ch7","W:Alchemy Table","At Level 3, it has expanded to three times its base size and includes a faucet as well as layers of shelves and drawers.")
