R('T',"Alchemy Table: Floor 4 coupons","Mordecai used Donut's two table coupons to take the Alchemy Table to level 3.","B3 ch7","V (2 families: wiki cite B3 ch7 + YT)","W:Alchemy Table","Mordecai used Donut's two table coupons on the Alchemy table to bring it to level 3.","YT:R6QqZjlm-rA","Mordecai upgrades the alchemy table")
