R('T',"Alchemy Table: specialization","Alchemy Tables can be specialized.","B3 ch30","V cite B3 ch30","W:Alchemy Table","Alchemy Tables can be specialized.")
R('T',"Alchemy Table: second table (Floor 4)","Mordecai spent table coupons on a second alchemy table, a metalworking table and a Bolt-Thrower's Workshop.","B3 ch30","V (2 families: wiki B3 ch30 + YT)","W:Bolt-Thrower's Workshop","Mordecai buys the Bolt-Thrower's Workshop from the marketplace on the Fourth Floor.","YT:FHLzs9fjyU8","used a table upgrade coupons to buy a second alchemy table, a metalworking table, and a bolt thrower's workshop")
R('T',"Alchemy Table: Floor 8 coupons","Carl used the two table upgrade coupons from his Scourge box on Mordecai's alchemy table so Liquid Therapy could be brewed.","B6 ch3,25","V cite B6 ch25",C,"Carl used the two table upgrade coupons from his Scourge box on Mordecai's alchemy table so that Liquid Therapy could be brewed for their guild.")
R('T',"Alchemy Table: Floor 9 upgrade","Newly upgraded table lets Mordecai examine a potion and learn its recipe (Revitalize Pet).","B7 ch2","V (2 families: wiki B7 ch2 + YT)","W:Mordecai","Mordecai is far more interested in his newly upgraded alchemy table, which for the first time lets him examine a potion and learn its recipe.","YT:FurNY4o0uCo","His upgraded alchemy table, though, lets him examine potion ingredients and recipes")
R('T',"Alchemy Table: celestial potion","Examining a Celestial-quality skill potion at his table taught Mordecai its recipe; brewing it would need more upgrades and special ingredients.","B7 ch4","V cite B7 ch4",C,"Examining a Celestial-quality skill potion at his table was enough for Mordecai to learn its recipe")
