R('T',"Other named tables","Repair Bench (B3 ch26) and the general-purpose Tinker's Table are named; most catalog tables cost around 25,000 gold.","B3 ch13,26","V cite B3 ch13",C,"Tables can be bought from a catalog at a safe room counter, where most cost around 25,000 gold")
