R('T',"Table coupons (Floor 4 rewards)","Carl received coupons for two crafting-table upgrades and two table upgrades of his choice (recap).","B3","UNVERIFIED (single YT recap)","YT:FHLzs9fjyU8","two crafting table upgrades, and two table upgrades of his choice")
R('T',"Table kit (supplies)","A 'crafting table kit' holds rare supplies for one of your tables.","B6 ch3","V cite B6 ch3","W:Dr. Ratchet's Automaton Build-It Kit","It'll contain a bunch of rare supplies for one of your tables.")
