R('T',"Personal space needed to use tools","Carl got the Goo-Inator in Book 1 but could not use it until he bought a Personal Space.","B1 ch30","V cite B1 ch30","W:Goo-Inator 3000","He is unable to use it until he purchases a Personal Space.")
