R('S',"Alchemy (skill)","Skill for mixing/brewing potions; does not require an Alchemy Table. Carl got level 3 from mixing Hair of the Dog.","B2 ch17","V cite B2 ch17","W:Alchemy Skill","Carl gains a level 3 alchemy skill for mixing up a Hair of the Dog Potion")
