R('S',"IED (skill)","Each level: +10% yield of improvised explosives and halves chance of premature detonation. Carl gained it at 3 on Floor 1, 7 after the Jug O' Boom.","B1 ch19,35","V cite B1 ch19","W:IED Skill","Each level in the IED Skill increases the damage of improvised explosives by 10%, and decreases the chance of early detonation by 1/2.","YT:j6jRXuCgsAA","unlocks an IED skill level three, which increases improvised explosive damage by 10% per level")
R('S',"Explosives Handling (skill)","Higher levels reveal more detail on explosives and unlock more crafting options; level 5 unlocks Demolitions Workshop at a Sapper's Table. Levels: 5 (B1 ch19), 7 (B1 ch35), 9 (B2 ch20), 11 (B3 ch27).","B1 ch19-35; B2 ch20; B3 ch27","V cite B1 ch19","W:Explosives Handling Skill","unlocks more crafting options.","W:Explosives Handling Skill","His skill increases to 7 after creating and using Carl's Jug O'Boom.")
R('S',"Dangerous Explosives Handling / Goblin Explosives (skills)","Carl gained Explosives Handling, Dangerous Explosives Handling and Goblin Explosives together on Floor 1.","B1 ch11","V cite B1 ch11","W:Goblin Explosives Skill","Carl gains the Explosives Handling Skill, Dangerous Explosives Handling Skill, and Goblin Explosives Skill simultaneously")
R('S',"Demolition Workshop tab (HUD)","Lets Carl remove bombs from inventory, see schematics, yield and decay rates; first used on Floor 4.","B1 ch19; B3 ch10","V cite B3 ch10","W:Demolition Workshop Tab","Carl gains access to this tab when his Explosives Handling Skill reaches level 5")
R('S',"Incendiary Device Handling (skill)","Gained by crafting/using incendiary devices; Carl jumped straight to level 5 on creating the Jug O' Boom.","B1 ch32","V cite B1 ch32","W:Incendiary Device Handling Skill","He immediately jumps to a level 5 in the skill.")
R('S',"Bomb Surgeon (skill)","Deconstruct bombs for parts and cut dynamite into smaller, weaker bombs; L1 can deconstruct Goblin Smoke Bombs.","B2 ch2,5","V cite B2 ch2","W:Bomb Surgeon Skill","a skill that allows a crawler to (a) deconstruct bombs to salvage their component parts, and (b) cut sticks of dynamite into smaller pieces")
R('S',"Bomb Surgeon: table synergy","At the Sapper's Table the bombs do not degrade, so Carl could cut sticks apart or bundle them.","B3 ch10","V cite B3 ch10","W:Bomb Surgeon Skill","Since he is standing at his Sapper's Table, the bombs do not degrade at all")
R('S',"Backfire (skill)","Pick up, deconstruct and reuse traps; an untriggered Alarm Module can be removed with 100% success. Carl got +5 from Compensated Anarchist.","B2 ch2; B3 ch1","V cite B2 ch2","W:Backfire Skill","Backfire is a rare skill that allows a crawler to pick up traps, deconstruct them, and reuse the components.")
R('S',"Trap Engineer (skill)","Carl's level determines which trap modifications require a Sapper's Table; +1 from Compensated Anarchist.","B3 ch1; B2 ch2","V cite B3 ch1",C,"A crawler's Trap Engineer level determines which trap modifications require a Sapper's Table.")
R('S',"Infusion (skill)","Carl has Infusion on Floor 5 (level 3 in the Floor-5 skill table); unstable infusions improve with skill, failures leave the Dud status.","B4 ch18","V cite B4 ch18",C,"Infused items are unstable, a problem that lessens as the crafter's Infusion skill rises, and failed infusions leave the item with the Dud status.")
R('S',"Sewing (skill)","Carl gained Sewing by sewing on the Midnight Epicure Upgrade Patch (Floor 6).","B5 ch44","V page cite B5 ch43-44","W:Carl_Floor 6","He sews it on himself, gaining the Sewing skill.")
R('S',"Compensated Anarchist (class)","Rare Earth class (Monk/Rogue); +5% trap-making and bomb-making skill progression; +1 Bomb Surgeon, +1 Trap Engineer, +5 Backfire, +5 Find Trap; needs Explosives Handling 5 and 500 billion views.","B2 ch2","V cite B2 ch2","W:Compensated Anarchist Class","+5% skill progression speed in all trap-making and bomb-making skills.","W:Compensated Anarchist Class","This rare and exclusive class is only available to crawlers who have obtained Level five in the Explosives Handling skill")
R('S',"Compensated Anarchist: minimum stats","Minimums 25 Charisma and 10 Dexterity; Carl spent 23 of 36 points (17 CHA, 6 DEX).","B2 ch2","V cite B2 ch2","W:Compensated Anarchist Class","Carl chose it, spending 23 of his 36 available stat points to meet its minimums (17 to Charisma, 6 to Dexterity).")
R('S',"Compensated Anarchist: subclasses","Must pick a subclass on Floor 6: Revolutionary (melee), Guerilla (traps/ranged), Agent Provocateur (explosives).","B2 ch2; B5 ch1","V cite B5 ch1","W:Compensated Anarchist Class","Compensated Anarchists must choose a subclass upon descent to the sixth floor.")
R('S',"Agent Provocateur (subclass)","Explosives/sabotage subclass: +1 INT per level-up, +1 Sapper's Table level, +2 Explosives Handling, advanced Bomb Maker's Workshop, faster explosives training. Carl chose it (level 47).","B5 ch1","V cite B5 ch1","W:Agent Provocateur Class","Access to the advanced Bomb Maker's Workshop.","W:Compensated Anarchist Class","He emerged as a level 47 Agent Provocateur.")
R('S',"Agent Provocateur: why Carl chose it","Carl wanted the advanced Bomb Maker's Workshop, which a few Cookbook recipes required, and an Intelligence fix.","B5 ch1","V cite B5 ch1","W:Compensated Anarchist Class","seeking the advanced Bomb Maker's Workshop, which a few recipes in his Dungeon Anarchist's Cookbook required")
R('S',"Guerilla (subclass)","Trap subclass: +1 DEX per level-up, Advanced Trap Maker's Workshop, Camouflage, +5 Crossbow, faster trap training (not chosen by Carl).","B5 ch1","V cite B5 ch1","W:Guerilla Class","Access to the Advanced Trap Maker’s Workshop.")
R('S',"Bomb Squad Tech (class)","AI-recommended Earth class (needs Boom! achievement): +5 Bomb Surgeon, +2 to explosive skills, handling no longer degrades explosives. Carl declined it.","B2 ch2","V cite B2 ch2","W:Bomb Squad Tech Class","The handling of explosives no longer degrades them.")
R('S',"Hobgoblin (race)","Needs Explosives Handling 5: +3 trap/explosive skills, +5% progression, skills raisable to 20, free access to Hobgoblin Sapper Workshops. Carl declined.","B2 ch2","V cite B2 ch2","W:Hobgoblin","Unlocks higher-tier explosives and trap-making abilities, allowing one to raise these skills to 20.","W:Hobgoblin","Free access to all Hobgoblin Sapper Workshops.")
